#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s is now in %(column)s."
msgstr "%(name)s és ara a %(column)s."

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s is now on %(when)s."
msgstr "%(name)s és ara el %(when)s."

#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s saved."
msgstr "S'ha desat %(name)s."

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Accions"

msgid "Agenda"
msgstr "Agenda"

msgid "Board"
msgstr "Tauler"

msgid "Calendar"
msgstr "Calendari"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Cancel·la"

msgid "Check what you entered"
msgstr "Revisa el que has escrit"

msgid "Clear all"
msgstr "Treu-los tots"

msgid "Days"
msgstr "Dies"

msgid "Details"
msgstr "Detalls"

msgid "Drag one to another day, or open it to change it with its form."
msgstr ""
"Arrossega'n un a un altre dia, o obre'l per canviar-lo amb el seu "
"formulari."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Each one is a bar from its first day to its last. The upright red line is"
" today, %(today)s."
msgstr ""
"Cadascun és una barra des del primer dia fins a l'últim. La línia "
"vermella vertical és avui, %(today)s."

msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Edita"

#, python-format
msgid "Edit %(name)s"
msgstr "Edita %(name)s"

msgid "Error"
msgstr "Error"

msgid "Fill in what is known: only what is marked as optional can wait."
msgstr ""
"Omple el que se sàpiga: només el que està marcat com a opcional pot "
"esperar."

msgid "Fit"
msgstr "Ajusta"

msgid "Last day"
msgstr "Últim dia"

msgid "List"
msgstr "Llista"

msgid "Month"
msgstr "Mes"

msgid "Months"
msgstr "Mesos"

msgid "Move a card with its own form, or drag it to another column."
msgstr ""
"Mou una targeta amb el seu propi formulari, o arrossega-la a una altra "
"columna."

msgid "Next"
msgstr "Següent"

msgid "No"
msgstr "No"

msgid "Not given"
msgstr "Sense indicar"

msgid ""
"Nothing of yours is saved yet, and what you typed is still here. They "
"saved what is listed below. Save again to replace it with what you typed,"
" or cancel to keep theirs."
msgstr ""
"Encara no s'ha desat res teu, i el que has escrit continua aquí. Aquesta "
"persona va desar el que apareix a sota. Desa una altra vegada per "
"substituir-ho pel que has escrit, o cancel·la per conservar el seu."

msgid ""
"Nothing of yours was moved. The card is where they left it: move it again"
" if you still want to."
msgstr ""
"No s'ha mogut res teu. La targeta és on la van deixar: torna-la a moure "
"si encara vols."

msgid "Nothing to show yet"
msgstr "Encara no hi ha res per mostrar"

msgid "Previous"
msgstr "Anterior"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Desa"

msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "Desant…"

msgid "Scale"
msgstr "Escala"

msgid ""
"Someone else changed this first. It is back where it was: reload the page"
" to see where it is now."
msgstr ""
"Una altra persona ho ha canviat abans. Ha tornat on era: recarrega la "
"pàgina per veure on és ara."

msgid "That could not be moved. It is back where it was."
msgstr "No s'ha pogut moure. Ha tornat on era."

#, python-format
msgid "The first %(shown)s of %(total)s, the earliest first."
msgstr "Els primers %(shown)s de %(total)s, primer els més antics."

msgid "The first one you add will be listed here."
msgstr "El primer que afegeixis apareixerà aquí."

msgid "This is no longer here: someone may have removed it."
msgstr "Això ja no és aquí: potser algú ho ha tret."

msgid "Timeline"
msgstr "Línia de temps"

msgid "Today"
msgstr "Avui"

msgid "Try fewer filters, or another word."
msgstr "Prova amb menys filtres o amb una altra paraula."

msgid "View"
msgstr "Mostra"

#, python-format
msgid "View %(name)s"
msgstr "Mostra %(name)s"

msgid "Week"
msgstr "Setmana"

msgid "Weeks"
msgstr "Setmanes"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Sí"

